oped in a laboratory hidden deep in a lake in Japan. Enter Dancouga, the Super Beast Machine God - and the battle's just beginning!\n\n(Source: Discotek Media)"},"tags":[{"name":"Military","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Aliens","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"War","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Super Robot","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Space","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Guns","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Dancouga: Super Beast Machine God","english":"Dancouga: Super Beast Machine God","native":"超獣機神ダンクーガ","romaji":"Choujuu Kishin Dancougar","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"超兽机神断空我"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}